.firebase/

# Eval shard intermediates (merged file is the artifact) + per-run logs.
# Matches both the flat layout (results/shards/) and versioned runs
# (results/v2/shards/, results/v2/score.log).
results/shards/
results/**/shards/
results/**/score.log

# Claude working notes: a local aid, not a project file.
CLAUDE.md

# Eval run artifacts: raw outputs and caches, not reports. The v5 RAGAS pass
# was only partially complete (41/127), so its metrics would mislead anyone
# reading them as a result. Keep the write-ups (RETRIEVAL_EXPERIMENTS.md,
# v1-v4 final_metrics.md) and leave the bulk data on disk.
results/v5/
# v6 is still being generated (a metered multi-day run); a mid-run snapshot
# reads as a finished result but isn't. Ignore until the run completes.
results/v6_partial/
results/financebench_gold_*.json
results/financebench_retrieval_queries_*.json
results/financebench_full_outputs*.json
